  "translation": "Today is Saturday, the weather is nice. My friend Xiao Wang and I often go to a very big supermarket together to shop. We first went to the fruit section inside the supermarket. The fruits there were all very fresh. I bought three apples and a cup of yogurt. Then we went to the drink section; I wanted a bottle of cola. But Xiao Wang asked me which kind of drink I liked; he suggested I buy juice instead of other drinks. I asked Xiao Wang, 'Do you want cola or juice?' He replied, 'I'll just drink water.' I looked at the price of the juice and thought it was too expensive, so I didn't buy anything. We then went to the snack section; there were several kinds of cookies, and those cookies looked very tasty. I chose a few pieces of chocolate, and Xiao Wang also bought a pack of potato chips. Finally, we went to the cashier. They were all queuing in front of the cashier; we could also pay with our mobile phones. From outside the supermarket, we quickly went home together. On the way, I chatted happily with Xiao Wang, and we agreed to come again next time. This weekend was really fun!"
